	(text "MMC5983MA - 4-wire SPI (MEMSIC MMC5983MA Rev A)\n- VDD = VDDIO = 3V3 (2.8-3.6 V), supply rise <= 5 ms. SPI up to 10 MHz; SCK idles high (mode 3).\n- C1 >= 10 uF low-ESR directly at CAP (pin 10, internally tied to VDD) - SET/RESET coil supply.\n- NC pins 3,6,7,8,12,14 unconnected. INT is active-high, hi-Z until enabled.\n- No current-carrying traces under/opposite the sensor; no magnetic parts nearby.\n- Footprint MEMSIC LGA-16 3x3 mm P0.5. J1: see connector note."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "364ca153-cd17-408a-b5cb-ba97b2c6adce")
	)
	(text "J1 HOST CONNECTOR - kept generic, part TBD\nRecommended flight: Harwin Gecko 1.25 mm, latching, 2x5 (10-pos)\nRecommended dev/EM: JST GH 1.25 mm, latching (Pixhawk-style cables)\nPlanned 10-pin, GND interleaved: 3V3, GND, SCK, GND, SDI,\n   SDO, GND, ~CS, INT, GND\nVerify connector magnetic signature near sensor before flight."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7493b7f6-7ed4-4f2e-82e1-8f3eba700b8c")
	)
